WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.083 --> 00:00:50.291
<b>In the last few verses, Lord Krishna </b>
<b>described the glory of a guru</b>

2
00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:53.625
<b>and explained the importance </b>
<b>of attaining spiritual knowledge.</b>

3
00:00:53.625 --> 00:00:58.500
<b>Now here, in the thirty-sixth and </b>
<b>thirty-seventh verses of the fourth chapter,</b>

4
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:03.333
<b>Lord Krishna is describing some other effects </b>
<b>of divine spiritual knowledge.</b>

5
00:01:08.041 --> 00:01:10.583
<b>There are two verses here.</b>

6
00:01:10.583 --> 00:01:15.875
<b>In the first verse, Lord Krishna tells Arjuna </b>
<b>that even if someone is the greatest sinner,</b>

7
00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:20.125
<b>that person, by the boat of this </b>
<b>divine spiritual knowledge,</b>

8
00:01:20.125 --> 00:01:24.000
<b>can cross this ocean of material miseries </b>

9
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.791
<b>Here, Lord Krishna is referring to </b>
<b>an extraordinary situation</b>

10
00:01:27.791 --> 00:01:31.333
<b>where someone has reached</b>
<b>the extreme limit of sin.</b>

11
00:01:31.333 --> 00:01:35.833
<b>Even such a person can purify their </b>
<b>mind with spiritual knowledge</b>

12
00:01:35.833 --> 00:01:39.000
<b>and lighten the burden of sins.</b>

13
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:45.458
<b>Arjuna was terrified by the sin of the death</b>
<b>of his relatives that would occur in this war.</b>

14
00:01:45.458 --> 00:01:49.000
<b>He was even refusing the duty of war.</b>

15
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.250
<b>So Krishna is telling him</b>

16
00:01:51.250 --> 00:01:56.833
<b>that turning away from one's actions is </b>
<b>never the path to liberation from sin.</b>

17
00:01:56.833 --> 00:02:01.291
<b>To be free from sin, one will have to adopt the </b>
<b>path of spiritual knowledge,</b>

18
00:02:01.291 --> 00:02:05.583
<b>which will purify the mind and lead to liberation.</b>

19
00:02:05.583 --> 00:02:07.958
<b>Then in the next verse, Lord Krishna says:</b>

20
00:02:07.958 --> 00:02:12.708
<b>"Just as a blazing fire turns firewood to ashes,</b>

21
00:02:12.708 --> 00:02:14.916
<b>similarly, the fire of knowledge</b>

22
00:02:14.916 --> 00:02:20.625
<b>also burns to ashes all the fruits of a </b>
<b>person's good and bad deeds."</b>

23
00:02:20.625 --> 00:02:26.333
<b>This is a state of purity, where there</b>
<b>is neither sin nor virtue;</b>

24
00:02:26.333 --> 00:02:29.583
<b>if there is anything, it is only the purity of the mind.</b>

25
00:02:29.583 --> 00:02:34.666
<b>However, it is necessary to understand one </b>
<b>more subtle aspect in these matters.</b>

26
00:02:34.666 --> 00:02:40.416
<b>A human being has received this life, this body, </b>
<b>only due to the results of past life's actions.</b>

27
00:02:40.416 --> 00:02:44.500
<b>These are the past actions, which </b>
<b>are called prarabdha karmas.</b>

28
00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:49.541
<b>As a result of these prarabdha karmas, that soul</b>
<b>has taken birth in the human species.</b>

29
00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:53.916
<b>The fruit of prarabdha karmas is this </b>
<b>present life of a human being.</b>

30
00:02:53.916 --> 00:02:59.083
<b>So as long as this life remains, the fruit </b>
<b>of those prarabdha karmas also remains.</b>

31
00:02:59.083 --> 00:03:04.125
<b>And then, complete liberation is </b>
<b>certainly possible after this material life.</b>

32
00:03:04.125 --> 00:03:08.166
<b>Ultimately, the core message of both these verses</b>

33
00:03:08.166 --> 00:03:12.208
<b>is that the power of spiritual </b>
<b>knowledge is filled with purity,</b>

34
00:03:12.208 --> 00:03:14.625
<b>and if we acquire this knowledge,</b>

35
00:03:14.625 --> 00:03:19.750
<b>we can be liberated from the bondage of karma </b>
<b>and all the cycles of virtue and sin,</b>

36
00:03:19.750 --> 00:03:24.291
<b>moving towards eternal peace and happiness.</b>

37
00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:35.250
<b>A good boat cannot change the ocean,</b>

38
00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.750
<b>but</b>

39
00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:43.291
<b>it can certainly help you in that ocean.</b>

40
00:03:43.291 --> 00:03:49.416
<b>Similarly, life is also like a vast ocean,</b>

41
00:03:49.416 --> 00:03:55.208
<b>in which many storms and waves </b>
<b>come to create turbulence.</b>

42
00:03:55.208 --> 00:04:03.458
<b>And true spiritual knowledge is like </b>
<b>a stable and powerful boat,</b>

43
00:04:03.458 --> 00:04:10.708
<b>riding which you will be able to face </b>
<b>all these storms and waves.</b>

44
00:04:10.708 --> 00:04:12.000
<b>Yes,</b>

45
00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:20.708
<b>this will not calm the ocean of life, nor will </b>
<b>the waves of difficulties end,</b>

46
00:04:20.708 --> 00:04:21.958
<b>but</b>

47
00:04:21.958 --> 00:04:27.375
<b>with this knowledge, you will certainly be </b>
<b>able to remain stable and safe.</b>

48
00:04:27.375 --> 00:04:34.583
<b>Take the example of a person who knows</b>
<b>the importance of patience.</b>

49
00:04:34.583 --> 00:04:41.083
<b>This very patience will help him in </b>
<b>difficult situations in life.</b>

50
00:04:41.083 --> 00:04:43.166
<b>That person will understand</b>

51
00:04:43.166 --> 00:04:48.041
<b>that difficult circumstances will pass with time,</b>

52
00:04:48.041 --> 00:04:51.708
<b>and this patience will save him from sorrow.</b>

53
00:04:51.708 --> 00:04:59.000
<b>On the other hand, one who lacks </b>
<b>this patience will be perturbed.</b>

54
00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:04.000
<b>In bad times, he may make some bad decisions,</b>

55
00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:08.041
<b>which can worsen the situation.</b>

56
00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:15.458
<b>Difficulties in life, good and bad circumstances,</b>
<b>these will always continue to occur.</b>

57
00:05:15.458 --> 00:05:16.625
<b>All that is needed</b>

58
00:05:16.625 --> 00:05:24.333
<b>is that we make the right decisions in those </b>
<b>circumstances and remain stable.</b>

59
00:05:24.333 --> 00:05:30.625
<b>And for this stability, the right spiritual</b>
<b>perspective is necessary.</b>

60
00:05:30.625 --> 00:05:33.291
<b>Remember this,</b>

61
00:05:33.291 --> 00:05:38.125
<b>because it is certainly important to have </b>
<b>knowledge about all the important subjects in life</b>

62
00:05:38.125 --> 00:05:39.208
<b>such as</b>

63
00:05:39.208 --> 00:05:45.500
<b>business, financial gain, etc.</b>

64
00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:51.041
<b>But this is all subject-specific knowledge. </b>

65
00:05:51.041 --> 00:05:55.666
<b>Whereas spiritual knowledge is the knowledge</b>

66
00:05:55.666 --> 00:06:00.916
<b>that will positively impact every aspect of life.</b>

67
00:06:00.916 --> 00:06:03.375
<b>And this will develop</b>

68
00:06:03.375 --> 00:06:05.250
<b>through self-reflection,</b>

69
00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:06.750
<b>meditation,</b>

70
00:06:06.750 --> 00:06:08.875
<b>study of scriptures,</b>

71
00:06:08.875 --> 00:06:12.500
<b>and taking shelter of a guru.</b>

72
00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:14.916
<b>Reflect upon this.</b>

73
00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:23.250
<b>Even the greatest sinner</b>

74
00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:31.708
<b>can cross this material ocean of sorrows by</b>
<b>the boat of divine spiritual knowledge.</b>

75
00:06:31.708 --> 00:06:32.958
<b>Yes,</b>

76
00:06:32.958 --> 00:06:36.166
<b>such a person has certainly done bad deeds,</b>

77
00:06:36.166 --> 00:06:40.958
<b>and he has also suffered the </b>
<b>consequences of these deeds.</b>

78
00:06:40.958 --> 00:06:42.166
<b>But</b>

79
00:06:42.166 --> 00:06:50.750
<b>even such a person ultimately gets an</b>
<b>opportunity for his spiritual upliftment.</b>

80
00:06:50.750 --> 00:06:52.333
<b>So think about it,</b>

81
00:06:52.333 --> 00:06:58.375
<b>if even such a person is worthy of </b>
<b>an opportunity in My sight,</b>

82
00:06:58.375 --> 00:07:05.916
<b>then in a family setting, being angry with</b>
<b>someone for a lifetime for a small mistake,</b>

83
00:07:05.916 --> 00:07:08.375
<b>not forgiving them,</b>

84
00:07:08.375 --> 00:07:11.375
<b>how is this appropriate?</b>

85
00:07:11.375 --> 00:07:16.083
<b>And by doing so, you are also </b>
<b>causing yourself suffering.</b>

86
00:07:16.083 --> 00:07:20.583
<b>The ego of not forgiving is</b>
<b>also flourishing within you.</b>

87
00:07:20.583 --> 00:07:24.625
<b>It is extremely important to have a sense </b>
<b>of forgiveness in the mind.</b>

88
00:07:24.625 --> 00:07:27.250
<b>This will not only cool you down</b>

89
00:07:27.250 --> 00:07:28.166
<b>but</b>

90
00:07:28.166 --> 00:07:33.750
<b>will also inspire the one who made</b>
<b>the mistake to improve.</b>

91
00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:38.333
<b>This thinking is also very important for parents.</b>

92
00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:42.958
<b>If parents, instead of scolding </b>
<b>when a mistake happens,</b>

93
00:07:42.958 --> 00:07:51.250
<b>discuss positive changes for the future, </b>
<b>provide support, forgive,</b>

94
00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:56.750
<b>then that child will definitely bring </b>
<b>a good change in their life.</b>

95
00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:58.416
<b>A forgiving attitude,</b>

96
00:07:58.416 --> 00:08:01.541
<b>sensitivity towards family members,</b>

97
00:08:01.541 --> 00:08:05.125
<b>and helping each other's progress.</b>

98
00:08:05.125 --> 00:08:09.541
<b>These are the three pillars of a happy family;</b>

99
00:08:09.541 --> 00:08:13.500
<b>don't let them weaken.</b>

100
00:08:18.291 --> 00:08:20.625
<b>In My creation,</b>

101
00:08:20.625 --> 00:08:24.208
<b>even the greatest sinner is given</b>
<b>the opportunity for penance</b>

102
00:08:24.208 --> 00:08:31.250
<b>and to walk on the spiritual path </b>
<b>to be freed from his sins.</b>

103
00:08:31.250 --> 00:08:32.541
<b>Because</b>

104
00:08:32.541 --> 00:08:37.291
<b>no mistake is entirely permanent.</b>

105
00:08:37.291 --> 00:08:39.583
<b> Everyone has the potential for upliftment.</b>

106
00:08:39.583 --> 00:08:44.583
<b>And this holds true in the </b>
<b>professional setting as well.</b>

107
00:08:44.583 --> 00:08:48.083
<b>Everyone has the ability to </b>
<b>learn from their mistakes,</b>

108
00:08:48.083 --> 00:08:51.500
<b>everyone has the potential to become excellent,</b>

109
00:08:51.500 --> 00:08:57.916
<b>if all that is needed is the </b>
<b>right knowledge and guidance.</b>

110
00:08:57.916 --> 00:09:00.958
<b>If you are in a leadership position,</b>

111
00:09:00.958 --> 00:09:10.541
<b>do you form a permanent negative opinion </b>
<b>about someone when they make a mistake?</b>

112
00:09:10.541 --> 00:09:14.041
<b>If so, change this thinking.</b>

113
00:09:14.041 --> 00:09:16.458
<b>Think for yourself,</b>

114
00:09:16.458 --> 00:09:21.625
<b>you too would have made professional </b>
<b>mistakes and learned from them.</b>

115
00:09:21.625 --> 00:09:26.083
<b>For any organization of </b>
<b>the new era, it is necessary</b>

116
00:09:26.083 --> 00:09:30.041
<b>that such an open environment is created there,</b>

117
00:09:30.041 --> 00:09:37.416
<b>where people instead of being ashamed and </b>
<b>hiding their mistakes, openly discuss them. </b>

118
00:09:37.416 --> 00:09:41.750
<b>And then instead of criticism,</b>

119
00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:46.583
<b>they receive the right knowledge from </b>
<b>senior officials and obtain guidance.</b>

120
00:09:46.583 --> 00:09:49.375
<b>Don't hide your eyes from mistakes,</b>

121
00:09:49.375 --> 00:09:50.916
<b>learn from them,</b>

122
00:09:50.916 --> 00:09:53.875
<b>and if you are in a leadership position,</b>

123
00:09:53.875 --> 00:09:58.250
<b>encourage this thinking in </b>
<b>the organization as well.</b>

124
00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:01.750
<b>Consider this modern thinking.</b>

